  tell that the product does table service, mix & match deals, gift cards,
  loyalty tiers, a receipt designer or offline trading — all of which ship.
  Every card below maps to something in the shipped software: the till
  (vesopa_epos) or the back office (vesopa_server).

  Three tabs rather than one 30-card wall: an operator evaluating the till and a
  manager evaluating the reporting are looking for different things.
%>
<div class="vf" id="features">
    <div class="vf-inner">
